@@ -0,0 +1,8 @@
+---
+features:
+  - |
+    ``Retrying``, ``AsyncRetrying`` and the ``@retry`` decorator accept a new
+    ``enabled`` parameter (default ``True``). When set to ``False``, the wrapped
+    function is called directly, exactly once, with no retry logic, and any
+    exception it raises propagates unchanged. This is useful during development
+    and testing.
